      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14239/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil; add potatoes and cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain and cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3JASGqrOvCgWgzprtGlBn1YPA2k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-14239-salad-nicoise-step-02-b3fed80eb24d4b0c9345bfff76b083dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14239/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine potatoes, green beans, tuna, onion, parsley, olives, and parsley in a large bowl; refrigerate for 2 to 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/isbarSNqTAgDO_ga7GSSqK73ytE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-14239-salad-nicoise-step-03-9129538eae514904a191886031c40258.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14239/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss greens with vinaigrette in a salad bowl; top with chilled potato mixture. Garnish with eggs, tomatoes, anchovies, and capers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
